        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dennis Bergkamp, Johan Cruyff, Wim Jonk, Jordi Cruyff, Ronald Koeman\n- Organizations: Inter Milan, Maccabi Tel Aviv\n- Roles: footballers, managers\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1993–94 season, Inter Milan acquired Dutch footballers Dennis Bergkamp and Wim Jonk.\n- Wim Jonk is the Dutch man referred to alongside Dennis Bergkamp.\n- Wim Jonk manages Johan Cruyff together with Jordi Cruyff.\n- Jordi Cruyff is a footballer who is also currently the manager of Maccabi Tel Aviv.\n- Johan Cruyff is managed by Wim Jonk and Jordi Cruyff.\n- Ronald Koeman is also a footballer who is currently manager of a Tel Aviv team.",
